Chapter: GptCoreCountGuard
  cites Foreword chapter Gpt
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 NumberOfPartitionEntries 100000, header CRC recomputed. The array would run to
 LBA 25002 on a 128-sector image and past FirstUsableLBA 34; the walk is bounded
 only by the first zero type GUID. Ablate the guard and this answers parts=1 esp=64,
 the count believed. Fixture from build/mint-gpt-core-fixtures.ps1.

 We say:

Section: Body

  esp-of : GptDisk -> Text
  esp-of (d) =
    when gpt-find-by-type d gpt-esp-type-guid
      is None -> "none"
      is Just (p) -> show (p.gp-start-lba)

  describe : Maybe GptDisk -> Text
  describe (g) =
    when g
      is None -> "gpt none"
      is Just (d) -> "gpt parts=" & show (d.gd-partition-count) & " esp=" & esp-of d

  opening : [Console, Device.Block] Nothing
  opening = act
    g <- gpt-read
    print-line-uni (describe g)
  end